      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Since you're experiencing physical symptoms like lightheadedness near the setup, it's best to first contact your local health department to report the smell. For mitigating odors near your residence, you could try installing a high-quality air purifier with a HEPA filter and activated carbon to catch particulates and absorb gasses. Additionally, ensuring good cross-ventilation in your bedroom when the misting is off might help disperse lingering smells.",
      "source": "target",
