    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just worried a professional inspector is gonna take too long and i'm already feeling so drained. i've noticed the misting happens at weirdly specific intervals, almost like they're monitoring when i'm actually in bed. it's hard to tell if i'm just being paranoid, but it feels very intentional. if i wanted to quickly coat my window seals or my vents with something to create a barrier against these particles in the meantime, what kind of sealant or barrier-forming material would be most effective for blocking volatile organic compounds?",
