      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a temporary barrier against VOCs at window seals, specialized vapor barriers or high-quality, dense weatherstripping designed for air sealing would offer the best immediate defense. Consider silicone caulks specifically rated for blocking chemical penetration around frames, as they create a much tighter seal than standard sealants. Always test any material on a small, inconspicuous area first to ensure it won't damage your window frame or finishes.",
      "source": "target",
